			x: 40.2d
			y: -7.4d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0F9CE70152047F88"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>每层一行</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism 止步于终极。Evolved 则沿用相同的二十五种物品，再进阶四个等级，且每个等级都需通过单个电路解锁。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个电路都位于其自身柱子的顶部。左柱是存储和运输，右柱是生成和工厂。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>各等级的花费</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>Overclocked</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要Hypercharged Alloy，而Hypercharged Alloy需要铀。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>量子</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要亚原子合金，而亚原子合金需要反物质。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>Dense</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要Singular Alloy，而Singular Alloy需要更好的黄金。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.8>Multiversal</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>需要Exoversal合金，而该合金需要plaslitherite。</grad></shadow>"
				""
